# ---- Gated / large data: NEVER commit ----
# hest-bench is a GATED HuggingFace dataset. inference_dump.pkl contains targets_all,
# i.e. measured expression from that dataset. Committing these redistributes gated data.
# NOTE: use 'bench_data/*' not 'bench_data/' - a trailing-slash ignore stops git
# descending into the directory, so the negations below would never be considered.
bench_data/*
!bench_data/INVENTORY.md
!bench_data/inventory.json
!bench_data/hest_bench_sample_inventory.csv
!bench_data/PROVENANCE.txt
embeddings/
*.pkl
*.h5
*.h5ad
*.parquet
*.zarr/
*.npz
*.npy

# Model weights / HF cache
hf_cache/
env/miniforge3/
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.bin

# CellViT segmentation downloads (Stage 4e)
instrumentation/cellvit_seg/
instrumentation/*.geojson
instrumentation/*.zip

# Upstream HEST clone - an embedded git repo. Its exact commit is pinned in
# env/REBUILD.md and env/requirements.lock, so vendoring it would only add noise.
code/HEST/

# SLURM / scratch
*.out
*.err
slurm-*.out
.claude-science-scratch/
logs/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Anything above the size guard should be added deliberately, never by wildcard

# Keep empty deliverable dirs visible
!.gitkeep

# Stage 5: third-party STFlow clone and symlink shim trees. Provenance (upstream URL, pinned
# commit, integration findings) is committed at code/stage5_provenance/STFLOW_SOURCE.txt.
code/stage5/
*.bak

# Working data, NOT a deliverable: the 130M-row prediction parquets, CellViT segmentations and
# per-task morphology parquets. Scripts write large intermediates here (DATA) and their small
# summary CSVs to results/tailored/<question> (OUT). See code/scripts/reorganize_repo.py.
instrumentation/

# macOS AppleDouble sidecars, created when a bundle is tarred on a Mac
._*
.DS_Store

# job scratch left by the closeout sweep
sweep_final.tsv
out_sweep_final.tsv

# on-disk cache of extracted file values (see verify_numeric_claims.py)
.verify-cache/
